><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/from-iraq-to-yemen-how-iran-linked-groups-are-putting-saudi-energy-routes-under-pressure/articleshow/134144723.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T22:28:24+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134145645,imgsize-1027781.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Trump opens 2.93M acres at Bears Ears, Grand Staircase-Escalante to new mining claims on September 11]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134141776.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In July 2026, Donald Trump removed monument protections from about 2.93 million acres at Bears Ears and Grand Staircase-Escalante in Utah. On September 11, the excluded lands became eligible for new mining claims and certain mineral activities, following the 60-day period set by presidential proclamations. The move has drawn criticism from conservation groups and advocates.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-july-2026-trump-removed-monument-protections-from-2-93-million-acres-at-bears-ears-and-grand-staircase-escalante-on-september-11-the-excluded-lands-became-eligible-for-new-mining-claims/articleshow/134141776.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-july-2026-trump-removed-monument-protections-from-2-93-million-acres-at-bears-ears-and-grand-staircase-escalante-on-september-11-the-excluded-lands-became-eligible-for-new-mining-claims/articleshow/134141776.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T21:28:57+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134142113,imgsize-143102.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Indian-origin man sentenced to 5 years 