.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[This mattress costs ₹7 crore and is made of horsehair; why the celebrities are buying it]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134139011.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[The Grand Vividus mattress by Hästens is priced at around ₹7 crore, making it a true luxury item. Crafted meticulously over hundreds of hours, this exclusive bed boasts natural materials such as horsehair, cotton, and wool, offering unparalleled comfort. Well-known personalities like Drake and Beyoncé endorse this elite brand, which also provides personalized fittings and premium mattresses in India.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/this-mattress-costs-7-crore-and-is-made-of-horsehair-why-the-ultra-rich-are-buying-it/articleshow/134139011.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/this-mattress-costs-7-crore-and-is-made-of-horsehair-why-the-ultra-rich-are-buying-it/articleshow/134139011.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T20:34:51+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134139736,imgsize-1364399.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[25 years after losing his father on 9/11, Casey joins the NYPD legacy]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134132908.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/at-4-casey-kloepfer-lost-his-nypd-father-on-9/11-25-years-later-he-became-an-nypd-officer-wears-his-fathers-badge-number-and-plays-for-the-lacrosse-team-his-father-founded/articleshow/134132908.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/at-4-casey-kloepfer-lost-h