ies. Australia, Oman, and Qatar are other key destinations for Indian migrants. These figures highlight the Gulf's significant role in Indian overseas migration.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/which-countries-are-home-to-the-largest-number-of-indian-migrants/articleshow/134138830.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/which-countries-are-home-to-the-largest-number-of-indian-migrants/articleshow/134138830.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T20:19:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Lifestyle Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134138946,imgsize-1285861.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[US lawmakers target 3 Indian tech firms: Why lawmakers want BellTroX, CyberRoot and former Appin blacklisted]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134140453.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-lawmakers-target-3-indian-tech-firms-why-lawmakers-want-belltrox-cyberroot-and-former-appin-blacklisted/articleshow/134140453.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/us-lawmakers-target-3-indian-tech-firms-why-lawmakers-want-belltrox-cyberroot-and-former-appin-blacklisted/articleshow/134140453.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-09-12T21:08:17+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134141361,imgsize-44356.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Who is Chander Agarwal? Indian-origin CEO who spent $370,000 on ex-girlfriend for luxury gifts, loses repayment case]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timeso